es by their final coding, which decides how the\nmessage is framed (RFC 9112 §6.3): `some true` when they end in `chunked` applied once, `some false`\nwhen they end in another coding or list none, and `none` when they are not lists of transfer\ncodings (`parseFieldLines?`) or end in a `chunked` applied more than once.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.finalCodingIsChunked?","kind":"def","line":203,"name":"Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.finalCodingIsChunked?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.lean#L203-L214"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parse\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Header</span>.<span class=\"name\">TransferEncoding</span>.<span class=\"name\">parse</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Value.html#Std.Http.Header.Value\">Value</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding\">TransferEncoding</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a comma-separated list of transfer codings from a header value (`parseCodings?`), validating\nchunked placement. Transfer parameters are accepted and dropped.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parse","kind":"def","line":192,"name":"Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parse","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.lean#L192-L201"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parseFieldLines?\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Header</span>.<span class=\"name\">TransferEncoding</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseFieldLines?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">values</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Value.html#Std.Http.Header.Value\">Value</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses the transfer codings of all of a message's `Transfer-Encoding` field lines, in order, with\n`parseCodings?`. The field lines of a list-based field form one list (RFC 9110 §5.3), so\n`Transfer-Encoding: gzip` followed by `Transfer-Encoding: chunked` is `gzip, chunked`.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parseFieldLines?","kind":"def","line":184,"name":"Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parseFieldLines?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.lean#L184-L190"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parseCodings?\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Header</span>.<span class=\"name\">TransferEncoding</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseCodings?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Value.html#Std.Http.Header.Value\">Value</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a comma-separated list of transfer codings into their lowercased names, without the chunked\nplacement rules of `parse`.\n\nEmpty list elements (`gzip, , chunked`) are skipped (RFC 9110 §5.6.1.2). Transfer parameters\n(`gzip;level=1`) are checked and dropped. `chunked` defines none, so a list in which `chunked` has\none is rejected. A quoted parameter value that contains `,` or `;` is not supported.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parseCodings?","kind":"def","line":166,"name":"Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.parseCodings?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.lean#L166-L182"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.isChunked\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Header</span>.<span class=\"name\">TransferEncoding</span>.<span class=\"name\">isChunked</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">te</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding\">TransferEncoding</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if the transfer encoding ends with chunked.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.isChunked","kind":"def","line":150,"name":"Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding.isChunked","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.lean#L150-L154"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.instReprTransferEncoding\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Header</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprTransferEncoding</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Repr.html#Repr\">Repr</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding\">TransferEncoding</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.instReprTransferEncoding","kind":"instance","line":146,"name":"Std.Http.Header.instReprTransferEncoding","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.lean#L146-L146"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.instReprTransferEncoding.repr\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">Header</span>.<span class=\"name\">instReprTransferEncoding</span>.<span class=\"name\">repr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/Headers/Basic.html#Std.Http.Header.TransferEncoding\">TransferEncoding</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Format/Basic.html#Std.Format\">Format</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/Head